1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Good morning everyone.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:08,099
This is the weekly community agriculture and school update for all residents.

3
00:00:08,099 --> 00:00:08,753
Firstly,

4
00:00:08,753 --> 00:00:15,461
the Village Water Committee has completed its inspection of all twelve percolation

5
00:00:15,461 --> 00:00:22,333
tanks along the Northern Ridge. The water storage capacity is seventy-eight percent,

6
00:00:22,333 --> 00:00:26,424
which is twenty percent higher than last November.

7
00:00:26,424 --> 00:00:35,578
Farmers who are planning to sow winter wheat and chickpeas are requested to register

8
00:00:35,578 --> 00:00:44,078
their drip irrigation maintenance slots at the Panchayat office before 5 PM on

9
00:00:44,078 --> 00:00:45,931
Thursday evening.

10
00:00:45,931 --> 00:00:46,503
Secondly,

11
00:00:46,503 --> 00:00:51,333
the Government Primary School will be hosting an annual science and language

12
00:00:51,333 --> 00:00:53,939
exhibition from 9 AM to 1 PM on Saturday.

13
00:00:53,939 --> 00:00:58,833
Students in classes four to eight will present working models on solar pumps,

14
00:00:58,833 --> 00:01:01,312
soil testing, and rainwater harvesting.

15
00:01:01,312 --> 00:01:05,950
Parents and grandparents are cordially invited to encourage the children.

16
00:01:05,950 --> 00:01:06,385
Thirdly,

17
00:01:06,385 --> 00:01:10,737
the mobile health clinic will visit the community hall between 10 AM and 2 PM on

18
00:01:10,737 --> 00:01:14,382
Tuesdays and Fridays. Free blood pressure screening, eye check-ups,

19
00:01:14,382 --> 00:01:18,570
and seasonal vaccinations will be available for senior citizens and children.

20
00:01:18,570 --> 00:01:23,007
Please bring your health cards so that records can be updated neatly. Fourthly,

21
00:01:23,007 --> 00:01:27,724
the Cooperative Grain Center has announced transparent procurement rates for millet,

22
00:01:27,724 --> 00:01:31,150
lentils, and groundnuts. Digital weighing will begin at 8 AM,

23
00:01:31,150 --> 00:01:35,418
and direct bank transfers will be settled within forty-eight hours. Fifthly,

24
00:01:35,418 --> 00:01:39,855
the rural library has added forty new storybooks and exam preparation guides in

25
00:01:39,855 --> 00:01:41,315
Hindi, Tamil, and English.

26
00:01:41,315 --> 00:01:46,304
Reading time in the evenings during weekdays has been extended until 7:30 PM.

27
00:01:46,304 --> 00:01:47,859
Thank you for listening.

28
00:01:47,859 --> 00:01:52,459
Please share this voice note with neighbors who may have missed today's

29
00:01:52,459 --> 00:01:56,800
announcement. Sixthly, the Village Dairy Cooperative Society has...

30
00:01:56,800 --> 00:02:01,335
A new solar-powered milk cooler has been installed near East Chauraha.

31
00:02:01,335 --> 00:02:03,991
The morning collection starts at 6:15 AM,

32
00:02:03,991 --> 00:02:07,426
and the evening collection runs from 5:30 PM to 7 PM.

33
00:02:07,426 --> 00:02:16,503
Digital fat test receipts will be printed instantly for each member of the family to

34
00:02:16,503 --> 00:02:20,826
ensure complete transparency in payment.

35
00:02:20,826 --> 00:02:29,687
The seventh block gardening office is distributing drought-resistant mango, guava,

36
00:02:29,687 --> 00:02:34,658
and drumstick saplings next Wednesday morning.

37
00:02:34,658 --> 00:02:43,581
Families who submitted their land parcel numbers last month can receive up to

38
00:02:43,581 --> 00:02:49,607
fifteen saplings per family free of charge. Finally,

39
00:02:49,607 --> 00:02:58,646
volunteers are organizing a weekend cleaning drive around the canal embankment

40
00:02:58,646 --> 00:03:00,615
starting at 7 AM.

41
00:03:00,615 --> 00:03:04,572
Drinking water and shaded rest tents will be arranged near the banyan tree.

42
00:03:04,572 --> 00:03:07,051
Thank you all for your cooperation and support.
